MigrationWatch --> WatchRegister
ConnectionWatch --> WatchRegister
CacheWatch --> WatchRegister
Owner --> WatchRegister : weekly review / assign owner
Partner --> WatchRegister : contribute remediation

SentryCloud -[#DC2626]-> SentryAlert
UptimeStore -[#DC2626]-> TeleBot
SentryAlert -[#DC2626]-> TeleBot : email / webhook*
UsageAlert -[#DC2626]-> TeleBot
